[size=4][b]Next-Gen AI Intimacy & Narrative Director for SkyrimNet + OStim[/b][/size]
[size=2][color=#aaaaaa]SE • AE • VR  |  Powered by SkyrimNet Decisions & OStim Navigator[/color][/size][/center]

[line]

[center][size=3][i]"Would you like to go somewhere a little more private?"[/i][/size][/center]

Forget immersion-breaking menus, robotic animation loops, and silent mannequins. [b]OStimNet[/b] bridges [b]SkyrimNet[/b] and [b]OStim Standalone[/b], turning intimate encounters into living, breathing roleplay.

Flirt by the tavern fire, negotiate a shady back-alley deal, share a comforting embrace, or whisper a request in the heat of passion—your words drive the action. Behind the scenes, an [b]AI Game Master[/b] evaluates character boundaries, selects context-appropriate animations, progresses scenes through natural stages, and lets NPCs react verbally to every touch, position shift, and climax.

[quote][b][color=#64b5f6]🧠 Personality First — Zero "Brainwashing"[/color][/b]
OStimNet [b]does not[/b] rewrite SkyrimNet's core prompts to make NPCs artificially horny or out-of-character. Characters strictly respect their established personalities, morals, and relationship boundaries. A happily married NPC or a stranger who dislikes you will turn you down—unless the narrative genuinely earns it.[/quote]

[line]

[size=5][b][color=#f4a261]✨ What Makes OStimNet Special[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*][size=3][b][color=#e9c46a]🎭 The AI Game Master & 6 Narrative Intents[/color][/b][/size]
Every encounter is driven by an underlying [b]Intent[/b]: [i]Platonic (Care), Romantic, Lustful, Transactional, Dominant,[/i] or [i]Aggressive[/i] (optional, disabled by default). Powered by SkyrimNet's fast [b]Decisions[/b] system, the AI verifies each participant's willingness, assigns dynamic roles ([i]Initiator/Responder, Dominant/Submissive, Provider/Recipient[/i]), finds nearby beds or furniture, and filters animations so a tender romance never randomly pulls a rough BDSM animation.

[*][size=3][b][color=#e9c46a]⏳ Natural Phase Progression[/color][/b][/size]
No more jarring jumps from fully clothed straight to the finish. Scenes evolve logically through distinct phases based on their mood:
[i]Undressing ➔ Foreplay ➔ Oral ➔ Intercourse[/i] (with multiple undressing styles supported via OStim, OARE, or OSA).

[*][size=3][b][color=#e9c46a]🗣️ Live Dialogue Control & Context Awareness[/color][/b][/size]
Talk mid-scene to [b]change positions[/b], [b]adjust the pace[/b], [b]shift the mood[/b], [b]invite bystanders[/b], or [b]stop[/b]. Thanks to hand-crafted and auto-generated scene descriptions, the AI knows [i]exactly[/i] who is doing what to whom—reacting to scene starts, position swaps, and climaxes. Includes built-in [b]OCum Ascended[/b] (fluid overlay awareness) and [b]Fertility Mode[/b] (cycle/pregnancy risk) context!

[*][size=3][b][color=#e9c46a]🌊 Interactive Pullout & Climax System[/color][/b][/size]
During vaginal intercourse, OStimNet monitors excitement and stalls climax right at the edge (default 85%). A sensory cue alerts the receiving partner to react in dialogue and execute a [b]Pullout Decision[/b]: [i]Request Pullout[/i], [i]Allow Finish Inside[/i], or [i]Leave it to Passion[/i]. When pulling out, [b]OStim Navigator[/b] seamlessly transitions the actors into a pose-matched non-vaginal finish (handjob, boobjob, cum-on, etc.).

[*][size=3][b][color=#e9c46a]🌍 A Living World: Location Scans & Spectators[/color][/b][/size]
Walk into an inn and OStimNet can quietly evaluate whether nearby NPCs would organically hook up based on their own relationships. Meanwhile, the [b]Spectators System[/b] lets nearby spouses, lovers, or curious bystanders discover active scenes—approaching to watch, make jealous or shocked comments, join in, or flee in embarrassment.

[*][size=3][b][color=#e9c46a]🛡️ 100% Player Agency & Third-Party Compatibility[/color][/b][/size]
Stay in total control with customizable [b]Confirmation Modals[/b]. And if you start a scene manually via OStim hotkeys or another mod, OStimNet automatically intercepts it—either letting the Game Master deduce the mood and roles retroactively, or popping up an interactive in-game menu so you can set them yourself.
[/list]

[line]

[size=5][b][color=#f4a261]🎮 Quick-Start Guide: How It Plays[/color][/b][/size]

[quote][b][color=#ff6b6b]⚠️ CRITICAL TIP: Use Keyboard Hotkeys for Confirmation Boxes![/color][/b]
When a Skyrim confirmation message box pops up during or before a scene, [b]NEVER click it with your mouse[/b]—a known Skyrim engine quirk can cause the camera to fly away. Always use your [b]keyboard hotkeys[/b] to select an option![/quote]

[size=3][b][color=#64b5f6]1. Starting an Encounter[/color][/b][/size]
Simply talk to an NPC! When the conversation naturally leads to physical intimacy—or a simple hug or kiss—the AI can trigger:
[list]
[*][b]StartCareScene[/b] — Platonic or romantic hugs and kisses (auto-ends after 20s).
[*][b]StartNewSex[/b] — Evaluates willingness, picks roles & intent, walks to nearby furniture, and begins the scene.
[*][b]JoinOngoingSex / InviteToYourSex[/b] — Seamlessly expands an active scene up to 5 participants via [i]OStim Hot Swap[/i].
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#64b5f6]2. Controlling an Active Scene[/color][/b][/size]
Once a scene is playing, you have three ways to direct the flow:
[list]
[*][b]By Voice / Text:[/b] Say [i]"Let's try doggy style," "Go faster," "Take control of me,"[/i] or [i]"Let's stop."[/i]
[*][b]With Hotkeys:[/b] Press the [b]Advance Player Scene Hotkey[/b] at any time to make the AI Game Master immediately pick the next logical position/phase, or press the [b]Toggle Mute Hotkey[/b] for a quiet moment.
[*][b]Via the OStim Menu:[/b] Open the OStim in-thread [i]Options ➔ OStimNet[/i] menu to instantly swap the [b]Intent[/b] or flip [b]Main/Secondary Actor Roles[/b] on the fly—no AI wait required.
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#64b5f6]3. Saying "No" (Confirmation Modals)[/color][/b][/size]
Whenever an NPC proposes starting or changing a scene with you, a confirmation popup gives you three choices (individually toggleable per action in settings):
[list]
[*][b]✅ Accept:[/b] The action proceeds immediately.
[*][b]❌ Cancel:[/b] Silently dismisses the action as if it never happened.
[*][b]✍️ Decline (Explain):[/b] Opens a text box so you can tell the NPC [i]why[/i] you're refusing (e.g., [i]"Not here in front of the Jarl!"[/i]). The NPC will react naturally in dialogue and back off for a configurable cooldown.
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#64b5f6]4. Customizing Settings & AI Triggers[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]In-Game Config:[/b] Open the [b]SkyrimNet Mod Menu ➔ OStimNet[/b] to configure cooldowns, confirmation gates, location scan filters, automatic AI scene advancement timers, undressing styles, and pullout thresholds.
[*][b]SkyrimNet Web Dashboard ([font=Courier New]http://localhost:8008[/font]):[/b] Go to [i]Automation ➔ Triggers[/i] to customize how often NPCs comment on scene starts, position changes, and climaxes—or enable [b]Scene End Diary Entries[/b] ([font=Courier New]tton_sex_stop_diary[/font]) so NPCs write private memories of your encounters!
[/list]

